# Unity-generated IDE integration assets
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# OS metadata and root-level diagnostic dumps
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
/sysinfo.txt
/mono_crash.*
/*.log

# Intentionally tracked: Assets/ and its .meta files (including Plugins/),
# Packages/manifest.json, Packages/packages-lock.json, ProjectSettings/,
# Docs/, Tests/, AGENTS.md, and Assets/Scripts/.editorconfig.
# Do not add blanket rules for *.meta, *.dll, or *.asset.
